{"url": "（本地文件）015、第十五节  类比身体部位与钟表部件，加深理解时间介词.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\015、第十五节  类比身体部位与钟表部件，加深理解时间介词.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 11.22, "text": "欢迎来到 Teacher Eric 三十天训练营的第十五节课。", "end": 16.72}, {"start": 16.72, "text": "Welcome to Teacher Eric's fifteenth lesson.", "end": 21.82}, {"start": 21.82, "text": "Now, we've learned prepositions, 我们接词、代词、pronouns这些都接触了。", "end": 29.51}, {"start": 29.51, "text": "又接触了时态,现在你们已经能够讲一些完整的句子了。", "end": 35.51}, {"start": 35.51, "text": "你们对时间的表述、数字也有一点的敏感性了。", "end": 40.21}, {"start": 40.21, "text": "所以我说过什么,反复的反复的进阶性的运用,", "end": 44.71}, {"start": 44.71, "text": "是我们贯穿我们这整个课程的一个核心的这个脉络。", "end": 49.21}, {"start": 49.21, "text": "同时可理解的输出,是支撑我们整个理解的基础。", "end": 53.71}, {"start": 61.21, "text": "你们会看到所有你们已经掌握过的或者学习过的知识。", "end": 65.71}, {"start": 72.19, "text": "记得啊,第三人称的动作最后会有一个s的声音。", "end": 85.58}, {"start": 85.08, "text": "她在拍摄,她在吃,她在吃。", "end": 91.08}, {"start": 91.08, "text": "他吃,她吃。", "end": 93.08}, {"start": 93.08, "text": "现在看看她的头发。", "end": 95.08}, {"start": 97.08, "text": "这是她的头发。", "end": 99.08}, {"start": 99.08, "text": "这是她的头发。", "end": 101.08}, {"start": 101.08, "text": "这是她的头发。", "end": 103.08}, {"start": 105.08, "text": "它是短的,它是长的。", "end": 107.08}, {"start": 109.08, "text": "它是短的,它是长的。", "end": 111.08}, {"start": 112.85, "text": "It is long.", "end": 115.49}, {"start": 115.49, "text": "Long, short.", "end": 119.54}, {"start": 119.54, "text": "Question.", "end": 121.54}, {"start": 121.54, "text": "Is Teacher Eric's hair long or short?", "end": 128.47}, {"start": 128.47, "text": "It's pretty short, right?", "end": 130.97}, {"start": 130.97, "text": "A little short.", "end": 133.54}, {"start": 133.54, "text": "But he has really short hair.", "end": 136.04}, {"start": 136.04, "text": "And she has really long hair, right?", "end": 139.54}, {"start": 139.54, "text": "Question.", "end": 141.04}, {"start": 141.04, "text": "How long is your hair?", "end": 143.54}, {"start": 143.54, "text": "Is your hair long or is your hair short?", "end": 149.04}, {"start": 149.04, "text": "Long, short.", "end": 152.72}, {"start": 152.72, "text": "这是我们今天新接触到的一个叫什么,adjective,形容词。", "end": 157.72}, {"start": 157.72, "text": "你们的词汇里已经有代词、介词、时间、方位各种了。", "end": 163.22}, {"start": 163.22, "text": "我们慢慢会增加一些什么形容性的东西去丰富我们的语言。", "end": 169.22}, {"start": 168.72, "text": "这些。这些。这些。这些。这些是他的耳朵。", "end": 178.72}, {"start": 178.72, "text": "这是他的耳朵。", "end": 181.72}, {"start": 182.89, "text": "有点恐怖啊。", "end": 184.39}, {"start": 189.39, "text": "对吧,Teacher Eric说过什么?", "end": 191.89}, {"start": 191.89, "text": "老外问问题一开始就会交代疑问的性质,right?", "end": 197.85}, {"start": 197.85, "text": "Where are her ears?", "end": 200.35}, {"start": 200.35, "text": "注意不是Where is her ears?", "end": 202.35}, {"start": 202.35, "text": "这里有两个,是一对,right?", "end": 204.85}, {"start": 204.85, "text": "所以是Where are her ears?", "end": 207.35}, {"start": 207.35, "text": "Where are they?", "end": 208.85}, {"start": 208.85, "text": "They are under her hair.", "end": 211.85}, {"start": 211.85, "text": "记不记得table的例子?", "end": 213.85}, {"start": 213.85, "text": "桌面我们说on the table。", "end": 215.85}, {"start": 215.85, "text": "如果是桌下呢?", "end": 217.35}, {"start": 217.35, "text": "Under the table,right?", "end": 219.35}, {"start": 219.35, "text": "They are under her hair.", "end": 222.67}, {"start": 222.67, "text": "So we cannot see them,right?", "end": 227.67}, {"start": 227.67, "text": "His ears are here.", "end": 229.67}, {"start": 229.67, "text": "These are his ears.", "end": 232.1}, {"start": 232.1, "text": "Where are her ears?", "end": 234.1}, {"start": 234.1, "text": "They are under her hair.", "end": 237.6}, {"start": 237.6, "text": "Her hair is over her ears.", "end": 242.35}, {"start": 242.35, "text": "上次接触over是不是时钟的时候?", "end": 244.85}, {"start": 244.85, "text": "This is a clock.", "end": 249.82}, {"start": 249.82, "text": "This is Teacher Eric.", "end": 252.58}, {"start": 252.58, "text": "The clock is over my head.", "end": 256.08}, {"start": 256.08, "text": "It is on my head.", "end": 258.08}, {"start": 258.08, "text": "It is over my head.", "end": 260.58}, {"start": 260.58, "text": "Right?", "end": 262.04}, {"start": 262.04, "text": "想起来了吧?", "end": 263.54}, {"start": 263.54, "text": "当时的例子是shell,right?", "end": 267.04}, {"start": 267.04, "text": "Her hair is over her ears.", "end": 270.04}, {"start": 270.04, "text": "Her hair is over her ears.", "end": 274.04}, {"start": 274.04, "text": "或者盖住也可以说over,right?", "end": 278.04}, {"start": 278.04, "text": "平时我们睡觉的时候怎么说?", "end": 281.04}, {"start": 281.04, "text": "Put the blanket over our body.", "end": 285.04}, {"start": 285.04, "text": "This is his head.", "end": 286.54}, {"start": 286.54, "text": "This is his face.", "end": 289.04}, {"start": 289.04, "text": "Head,face.", "end": 292.97}, {"start": 292.97, "text": "This is his head.", "end": 294.97}, {"start": 294.97, "text": "This is his face.", "end": 297.56}, {"start": 297.56, "text": "This is his face.", "end": 299.56}, {"start": 299.56, "text": "His eyes,his nose,his mouth are parts of his face.", "end": 306.06}, {"start": 306.06, "text": "A ear is part of my face.", "end": 310.56}, {"start": 310.56, "text": "说的是什么呀?", "end": 311.56}, {"start": 311.56, "text": "记住我们说of的时候是说明什么?", "end": 314.06}, {"start": 314.06, "text": "后者是前者的总体。", "end": 317.56}, {"start": 317.56, "text": "So ear is a part of a face.", "end": 320.56}, {"start": 320.56, "text": "Eyes is a part of a face.", "end": 323.56}, {"start": 323.56, "text": "Nose is a part of a face.", "end": 326.06}, {"start": 326.06, "text": "And mouth is a part of a face.", "end": 328.56}, {"start": 328.56, "text": "说的是啥呀?", "end": 330.06}, {"start": 330.06, "text": "这都是脸的一部分,right?", "end": 332.06}, {"start": 332.06, "text": "所以这里用了of。", "end": 333.56}, {"start": 333.56, "text": "那当然另外一个要注意的也是我们接触过的,", "end": 336.06}, {"start": 336.06, "text": "就是part,p-a-r-t,part.", "end": 339.56}, {"start": 339.56, "text": "part是什么意思呢?", "end": 341.06}, {"start": 341.06, "text": "部分,right?", "end": 343.06}, {"start": 343.06, "text": "A part of something是最通用的形容一个部分了。", "end": 347.06}, {"start": 347.06, "text": "什么情况你都可以这么去用。", "end": 350.06}, {"start": 350.06, "text": "Alright?", "end": 351.06}, {"start": 351.06, "text": "但凡只要是他的一个部分,", "end": 353.06}, {"start": 353.06, "text": "不论是软的、硬的、有机的、无机的,", "end": 356.56}, {"start": 356.56, "text": "抽象的还是具象的都可以说part。", "end": 359.56}, {"start": 359.56, "text": "part的原意是什么?", "end": 361.56}, {"start": 361.56, "text": "分离或者分别。", "end": 363.56}, {"start": 363.56, "text": "所以老外说什么?", "end": 365.06}, {"start": 365.06, "text": "A part of。", "end": 366.06}, {"start": 366.06, "text": "分离的一部分,right?", "end": 368.06}, {"start": 368.06, "text": "所以通用性很高。", "end": 369.56}, {"start": 369.56, "text": "这是英语的高频词汇。", "end": 371.56}, {"start": 371.56, "text": "大家可以借此机会去感受它的运用。", "end": 374.56}, {"start": 374.56, "text": "Alright?", "end": 375.56}, {"start": 375.56, "text": "Eyes,nose,ears,mouth are parts of a face.", "end": 383.48}, {"start": 383.48, "text": "我总的说就要用复述了。", "end": 385.98}, {"start": 385.98, "text": "这些东西是parts of a face.", "end": 388.98}, {"start": 388.98, "text": "This is a clock.", "end": 390.48}, {"start": 390.48, "text": "It has a face。", "end": 392.48}, {"start": 392.48, "text": "注意哦。", "end": 394.13}, {"start": 394.13, "text": "It has a face。", "end": 396.13}, {"start": 396.13, "text": "我们在描述除了我和你以外的所有东西,", "end": 401.68}, {"start": 401.68, "text": "在说他的事情的时候,", "end": 403.68}, {"start": 403.68, "text": "都会加一个s的尾音。", "end": 406.18}, {"start": 406.18, "text": "在动词后面。", "end": 407.68}, {"start": 407.68, "text": "那当然这里注动词是has,right?", "end": 410.18}, {"start": 410.18, "text": "So have has。", "end": 412.68}, {"start": 412.68, "text": "如果是我,I have a face。", "end": 415.62}, {"start": 415.62, "text": "如果是你,you have a face。", "end": 418.12}, {"start": 418.12, "text": "如果是别人或者别的物体,", "end": 420.62}, {"start": 420.62, "text": "我们不是很确定。", "end": 422.12}, {"start": 422.12, "text": "所以会加一个语言的记号。", "end": 424.12}, {"start": 424.12, "text": "就是s。", "end": 425.62}, {"start": 425.62, "text": "复述也是这个道理。", "end": 427.62}, {"start": 427.62, "text": "Apple,apples.", "end": 429.62}, {"start": 429.62, "text": "它是一种模糊或者委婉的处理方式。", "end": 433.62}, {"start": 433.62, "text": "也是少数英语仍然保留的动词尾音。", "end": 437.62}, {"start": 437.62, "text": "或者名词尾音。", "end": 440.3}, {"start": 440.3, "text": "It has a face.", "end": 441.8}, {"start": 441.8, "text": "It does have a face.", "end": 443.3}, {"start": 443.3, "text": "A clock has a face.", "end": 447.9}, {"start": 447.9, "text": "A face,right?", "end": 449.9}, {"start": 449.9, "text": "什么还有face呢?", "end": 451.4}, {"start": 451.4, "text": "我反问大家。", "end": 452.4}, {"start": 452.4, "text": "What has a face?", "end": 456.0}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "We could say the face of a table,", "end": 460.0}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "the face of a painting,", "end": 462.0}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "the face of a frame。", "end": 464.0}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "讲的都是它的正面。", "end": 466.0}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "就像中文我们说面,", "end": 468.0}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "英语会说face。", "end": 469.5}, {"start": 469.5, "text": "So the clock has a face,right?", "end": 472.0}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "This is the face of the clock。", "end": 474.0}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "这里提醒大家怎么去用of。", "end": 476.5}, {"start": 476.5, "text": "如果the clock在后面,", "end": 479.0}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "the face在前面。", "end": 480.5}, {"start": 480.5, "text": "我们认为face是clock的一部分。", "end": 483.5}, {"start": 483.5, "text": "所以说of。", "end": 485.5}, {"start": 485.5, "text": "This is the face of the clock。", "end": 487.5}, {"start": 487.5, "text": "如果某个小男孩是某个家庭的一员,", "end": 491.5}, {"start": 491.5, "text": "我们就会说the boy is part of a family。", "end": 495.5}, {"start": 495.5, "text": "对吧?", "end": 496.5}, {"start": 496.5, "text": "这里of又是一个呈现。", "end": 498.5}, {"start": 498.5, "text": "The clock has two hands.", "end": 500.5}, {"start": 500.5, "text": "Hands。", "end": 501.5}, {"start": 501.5, "text": "注意我们讲指针,老外讲手。", "end": 504.5}, {"start": 504.5, "text": "所以它除了有一个什么面,", "end": 506.5}, {"start": 506.5, "text": "还有两只手。", "end": 508.5}, {"start": 508.5, "text": "The clock has two hands,", "end": 511.5}, {"start": 511.5, "text": "a long hand,", "end": 513.5}, {"start": 513.5, "text": "and a short hand.", "end": 515.5}, {"start": 515.5, "text": "是不是刚学的?", "end": 516.5}, {"start": 516.5, "text": "Long hair,", "end": 518.5}, {"start": 518.5, "text": "short hair,", "end": 520.5}, {"start": 520.5, "text": "long hand,", "end": 522.5}, {"start": 522.5, "text": "short hand.", "end": 523.5}, {"start": 523.5, "text": "The long hand is at five,", "end": 526.5}, {"start": 526.5, "text": "and the short hand is between seven and eight.", "end": 529.5}, {"start": 529.5, "text": "这是不是十四节刚学的?", "end": 531.5}, {"start": 531.5, "text": "The long hand is at five o'clock,", "end": 534.5}, {"start": 534.5, "text": "the long hand is at five,", "end": 540.21}, {"start": 540.21, "text": "and the short hand is between seven and eight.", "end": 545.83}, {"start": 545.83, "text": "Between seven and eight.", "end": 547.83}, {"start": 547.83, "text": "那是几点钟啊?", "end": 549.83}, {"start": 549.83, "text": "考考你们。", "end": 550.83}, {"start": 550.83, "text": "It's almost seven thirty.", "end": 552.83}, {"start": 552.83, "text": "快七点半了。", "end": 554.83}, {"start": 554.83, "text": "Five more minutes.", "end": 556.83}, {"start": 556.83, "text": "There are five more minutes.", "end": 559.83}, {"start": 559.83, "text": "It's seven thirty.", "end": 561.83}, {"start": 561.83, "text": "The long hand is at five,", "end": 563.83}, {"start": 563.83, "text": "and the short hand is between seven and eight.", "end": 566.83}, {"start": 566.83, "text": "A between.", "end": 568.83}, {"start": 568.83, "text": "Between, right?", "end": 570.83}, {"start": 570.83, "text": "想起来了吧?", "end": 571.83}, {"start": 571.83, "text": "刚学的, right?", "end": 572.83}, {"start": 572.83, "text": "Teacher Eric,", "end": 575.67}, {"start": 575.67, "text": "I have a face.", "end": 577.67}, {"start": 577.67, "text": "I have eyes.", "end": 580.39}, {"start": 580.39, "text": "I have a nose.", "end": 582.39}, {"start": 582.39, "text": "I have a mouth.", "end": 584.39}, {"start": 584.39, "text": "And I have ears.", "end": 586.5}, {"start": 586.5, "text": "This is a clock.", "end": 589.02}, {"start": 589.02, "text": "A clock has a face.", "end": 591.02}, {"start": 591.02, "text": "Like me, a face.", "end": 593.62}, {"start": 593.62, "text": "It has no nose.", "end": 596.62}, {"start": 596.62, "text": "It has no eyes.", "end": 599.62}, {"start": 599.62, "text": "It has no mouth.", "end": 602.72}, {"start": 602.72, "text": "Does it have arms?", "end": 604.72}, {"start": 604.72, "text": "Yes.", "end": 605.72}, {"start": 605.72, "text": "It has no ears.", "end": 607.72}, {"start": 607.72, "text": "It has no hair.", "end": 609.72}, {"start": 609.72, "text": "But it has a face.", "end": 611.72}, {"start": 611.72, "text": "But.", "end": 613.22}, {"start": 613.22, "text": "It has a face.", "end": 616.22}, {"start": 616.22, "text": "这里带出一个非常重要的字。", "end": 619.68}, {"start": 619.68, "text": "But.", "end": 621.68}, {"start": 621.68, "text": "我们之前学过because, right?", "end": 623.68}, {"start": 623.68, "text": "But 是什么意思呢?", "end": 624.68}, {"start": 624.68, "text": "如果有东西是这样的在发展,", "end": 630.41}, {"start": 630.41, "text": "但是突然间要转折,", "end": 633.41}, {"start": 633.41, "text": "什么叫转折?", "end": 634.94}, {"start": 634.94, "text": "就是要变相。", "end": 635.94}, {"start": 635.94, "text": "But.", "end": 637.82}, {"start": 637.82, "text": "所以这里说了什么?", "end": 640.82}, {"start": 640.82, "text": "It doesn't have eyes.", "end": 641.82}, {"start": 641.82, "text": "No nose.", "end": 642.82}, {"start": 642.82, "text": "No mouth.", "end": 643.82}, {"start": 643.82, "text": "No ears.", "end": 644.82}, {"start": 644.82, "text": "But.", "end": 645.82}, {"start": 645.82, "text": "It has a face.", "end": 647.82}, {"start": 647.82, "text": "从否定,否定,否定,", "end": 649.82}, {"start": 649.82, "text": "突然转肯定。", "end": 651.82}, {"start": 651.82, "text": "它说什么?", "end": 652.82}, {"start": 652.82, "text": "But.", "end": 653.82}, {"start": 653.82, "text": "这是你们第一次接触这个词。", "end": 655.82}, {"start": 655.82, "text": "当然,现场有很多人听过这个词,", "end": 657.82}, {"start": 657.82, "text": "因为是英语里面的", "end": 659.82}, {"start": 659.82, "text": "衔接词里排前三了。", "end": 661.82}, {"start": 661.82, "text": "我们还学过什么?", "end": 663.82}, {"start": 663.82, "text": "So.", "end": 664.82}, {"start": 664.82, "text": "Because.", "end": 665.82}, {"start": 665.82, "text": "今天是but。", "end": 666.82}, {"start": 666.82, "text": "它也是你必须带走的", "end": 668.82}, {"start": 668.82, "text": "最基本的一个衔接词。", "end": 670.82}, {"start": 670.82, "text": "表达转折。", "end": 672.82}, {"start": 672.82, "text": "中文我们说什么?", "end": 673.82}, {"start": 673.82, "text": "但是, right?", "end": 674.82}, {"start": 674.82, "text": "But.", "end": 675.82}, {"start": 675.82, "text": "It has a face.", "end": 676.82}, {"start": 676.82, "text": "这是非常好的例子。", "end": 678.61}, {"start": 678.61, "text": "It has a face and two hands.", "end": 681.61}, {"start": 681.61, "text": "The long hand and the short hand.", "end": 686.14}, {"start": 686.14, "text": "The long hand and the short hand.", "end": 688.7}, {"start": 688.7, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 691.7}, {"start": 691.7, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 693.7}, {"start": 693.7, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 696.17}, {"start": 696.17, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 699.56}, {"start": 699.56, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 701.56}, {"start": 701.56, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 703.56}, {"start": 703.56, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 706.54}, {"start": 706.54, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 711.98}, {"start": 711.98, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 713.98}, {"start": 713.98, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 717.05}, {"start": 717.05, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 719.05}, {"start": 719.05, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 722.98}, {"start": 722.98, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 724.98}, {"start": 724.98, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 726.98}, {"start": 726.98, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 729.7}, {"start": 729.7, "text": "The long hand of the clock.", "end": 731.7}, {"start": 731.7, "text": "3 is after 2 and 2 is after 1", "end": 738.39}, {"start": 738.39, "text": "3 is after 2, 2 is after 1", "end": 742.71}, {"start": 742.71, "text": "1 is before 2, 2 is before 3", "end": 746.55}, {"start": 746.55, "text": "這裡把after和before做了一個很好的對比", "end": 749.91}, {"start": 749.91, "text": "1 is before 2, 2 is after 1", "end": 757.03}, {"start": 757.03, "text": "他表達了他的關係", "end": 760.15}, {"start": 760.15, "text": "如果teacher要解釋before", "end": 764.15}, {"start": 764.82, "text": "before", "end": 771.85}, {"start": 771.85, "text": "what is be", "end": 775.0}, {"start": 775.0, "text": "be就是存在", "end": 777.24}, {"start": 777.24, "text": "we always say that", "end": 778.28}, {"start": 778.28, "text": "to be or not to be", "end": 779.8}, {"start": 779.8, "text": "right", "end": 780.76}, {"start": 780.76, "text": "for是什麼", "end": 783.43}, {"start": 783.43, "text": "for", "end": 786.38}, {"start": 786.38, "text": "so before是什麼意思", "end": 790.07}, {"start": 790.07, "text": "一個東西存在於眼前", "end": 792.9}, {"start": 792.9, "text": "中國人講之前", "end": 795.54}, {"start": 795.54, "text": "有沒有跟英語一模一樣", "end": 797.7}, {"start": 797.7, "text": "那個之就是be", "end": 799.54}, {"start": 799.54, "text": "錢就是for", "end": 800.74}, {"start": 800.74, "text": "這還真不是翻譯的", "end": 802.34}, {"start": 802.34, "text": "只能說人類的思維最後是想通的", "end": 805.3}, {"start": 805.94, "text": "so before", "end": 807.82}, {"start": 807.82, "text": "so one is before two", "end": 810.38}, {"start": 810.38, "text": "那before相反的怎麼表達", "end": 812.7}, {"start": 812.7, "text": "我們說one is before two", "end": 815.1}, {"start": 815.1, "text": "這個就是before two", "end": 817.11}, {"start": 817.11, "text": "right", "end": 818.07}, {"start": 818.07, "text": "那如果是這樣呢", "end": 820.39}, {"start": 820.39, "text": "那就是two is after one", "end": 823.53}, {"start": 823.53, "text": "right", "end": 823.93}, {"start": 823.93, "text": "這裡我們先接觸before", "end": 826.25}, {"start": 826.25, "text": "下次我細細的給你們講after", "end": 828.89}, {"start": 828.89, "text": "one is before two", "end": 830.57}, {"start": 830.57, "text": "two is between one and three", "end": 834.71}, {"start": 834.71, "text": "between", "end": 837.13}, {"start": 837.13, "text": "three is after two", "end": 838.89}, {"start": 838.89, "text": "and two is after one", "end": 840.97}, {"start": 840.97, "text": "好", "end": 841.93}, {"start": 841.93, "text": "以後會大量反覆接觸", "end": 843.93}, {"start": 843.93, "text": "我一直說什麼", "end": 844.73}, {"start": 844.73, "text": "不要這個時候就拿起筆", "end": 846.49}, {"start": 846.49, "text": "在那邊記在那邊背單詞", "end": 848.33}, {"start": 848.33, "text": "還要把中文解釋放在那種感受運用", "end": 853.4}, {"start": 853.4, "text": "now something happened here", "end": 855.16}, {"start": 855.16, "text": "我們的劇情越來越生動了", "end": 856.84}, {"start": 856.84, "text": "right", "end": 858.18}, {"start": 858.18, "text": "I have this book in my hands", "end": 860.5}, {"start": 861.3, "text": "I have", "end": 865.37}, {"start": 865.37, "text": "I have this book", "end": 867.13}, {"start": 868.09, "text": "in my hands", "end": 869.53}, {"start": 869.53, "text": "in my hands", "end": 870.73}, {"start": 870.73, "text": "right", "end": 872.34}, {"start": 872.34, "text": "it was on the shelf", "end": 874.02}, {"start": 874.74, "text": "it was on the shelf", "end": 876.34}, {"start": 877.06, "text": "it's in my hands", "end": 878.5}, {"start": 878.5, "text": "it is in my hands", "end": 880.42}, {"start": 880.42, "text": "it was on the shelf", "end": 882.34}, {"start": 882.34, "text": "right", "end": 882.98}, {"start": 882.98, "text": "差不多第三第四節課的內容了", "end": 885.38}, {"start": 885.38, "text": "right", "end": 885.7}, {"start": 887.14, "text": "it was on the shelf with the other books", "end": 891.14}, {"start": 891.14, "text": "this book", "end": 892.18}, {"start": 892.18, "text": "the other books", "end": 893.62}, {"start": 894.34, "text": "right", "end": 894.74}, {"start": 894.74, "text": "the book", "end": 895.78}, {"start": 895.78, "text": "the other books", "end": 897.14}, {"start": 898.84, "text": "it was between the other two books", "end": 901.72}, {"start": 902.52, "text": "it was between the other two books", "end": 906.76}, {"start": 908.47, "text": "before I took it from the shelf", "end": 911.03}, {"start": 917.27, "text": "these are the other books", "end": 918.95}, {"start": 919.83, "text": "this is the book", "end": 922.54}, {"start": 922.54, "text": "the book was", "end": 923.42}, {"start": 927.51, "text": "the book was between the other two books", "end": 931.03}, {"start": 932.09, "text": "before I took it from the shelf", "end": 935.69}, {"start": 936.25, "text": "注意這裡take變成了什麼", "end": 938.49}, {"start": 938.49, "text": "took", "end": 939.29}, {"start": 939.29, "text": "我們一直說說音是過去式", "end": 941.21}, {"start": 941.29, "text": "所以take的過去式是 took", "end": 943.93}, {"start": 943.93, "text": "所以之前teacher Eric拿走的之前", "end": 946.97}, {"start": 946.97, "text": "right", "end": 947.29}, {"start": 947.29, "text": "look", "end": 947.53}, {"start": 947.53, "text": "before I took it", "end": 949.21}, {"start": 949.93, "text": "before", "end": 950.97}, {"start": 950.97, "text": "剛剛是one is before two", "end": 952.81}, {"start": 952.81, "text": "two is before three", "end": 954.09}, {"start": 954.09, "text": "現在是時間上的", "end": 956.17}, {"start": 956.17, "text": "before teacher Eric took it", "end": 958.49}, {"start": 959.13, "text": "在我拿走這件事完成之前", "end": 961.93}, {"start": 963.18, "text": "the book was between the other books", "end": 966.86}, {"start": 966.86, "text": "所以他們是這樣子在書架上", "end": 969.58}, {"start": 969.58, "text": "right", "end": 971.4}, {"start": 971.4, "text": "你看", "end": 972.28}, {"start": 972.28, "text": "你們現在已經能夠看懂跟理解", "end": 974.6}, {"start": 974.6, "text": "很複雜的長句了", "end": 976.68}, {"start": 976.68, "text": "所以很多人評說我teacher", "end": 978.12}, {"start": 978.12, "text": "我長句他們懂怎麼辦", "end": 980.92}, {"start": 980.92, "text": "是不是你已經走到這裡了", "end": 982.76}, {"start": 982.76, "text": "無非是這些東西", "end": 984.68}, {"start": 984.68, "text": "顛來倒去", "end": 985.72}, {"start": 985.72, "text": "一路到高考畢業", "end": 987.24}, {"start": 987.24, "text": "I have this book in my hands", "end": 989.16}, {"start": 989.16, "text": "這次直接對著圖了", "end": 990.6}, {"start": 991.16, "text": "it was on the shelf", "end": 994.78}, {"start": 994.78, "text": "with the other two books", "end": 996.3}, {"start": 996.86, "text": "it was between the other two books", "end": 999.02}, {"start": 999.66, "text": "it was between the other two books", "end": 1001.74}, {"start": 1002.3, "text": "before I took it from the shelf", "end": 1005.82}, {"start": 1006.46, "text": "這裡還有一個重要的概念是 from", "end": 1008.78}, {"start": 1008.78, "text": "right", "end": 1009.34}, {"start": 1009.34, "text": "where are you from", "end": 1010.78}, {"start": 1011.34, "text": "你從哪裡來", "end": 1012.38}, {"start": 1012.38, "text": "right", "end": 1012.78}, {"start": 1012.78, "text": "where are you from", "end": 1013.58}, {"start": 1014.14, "text": "I am from the USA", "end": 1015.98}, {"start": 1015.98, "text": "where are you from", "end": 1016.86}, {"start": 1017.5, "text": "you are from China", "end": 1019.66}, {"start": 1020.46, "text": "the book is from the shelf", "end": 1023.42}, {"start": 1023.42, "text": "right", "end": 1023.66}, {"start": 1024.54, "text": "這個接詞", "end": 1025.5}, {"start": 1025.5, "text": "到這個地方為止", "end": 1026.86}, {"start": 1026.86, "text": "我覺得我們可以緩一下", "end": 1028.62}, {"start": 1028.62, "